  "details": "VRChat Build 1067\nI recently noticed that VRChat will crash if you start with RivaTuner Statistics Server running in the background. RivaTuner Statistics Server is a Software to monitor your usage of PC hardware like graphics card usage, cpu, temps and so on. It's not that dramatic if this wont be fixed but I still want to point it out, maybe it's easy to fix.\nTo reproduce just open RivaTuner Statistics Server and watch VRChat crash if you tap into it.",
